Project 3: Analyzing and Visualizing Movie Ratings

Overview

This project focuses on analyzing a movie ratings dataset to uncover trends, patterns, and insights through data visualization techniques.

Objectives

- Explore the movie ratings dataset.
- Analyze rating distributions and trends.
- Visualize data using charts and graphs.
- Identify patterns and audience preferences.
- Present insights through effective visualizations.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib

Learning Outcomes

- Strengthened data analysis and visualization skills.
- Learned to interpret movie rating patterns.
- Improved proficiency in Python and Pandas.
- Gained hands-on experience with exploratory data analysis.

